==== EvolvedRecipeName ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the display name when adding an item as an ingredient to an Evolved Recipe.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
EvolvedRecipeName = Beef,
</syntaxhighlight>
